{title: Tum Bin Jiya Jaye Kaise}
{artist: Chithra Tum Bin}
{key: A}

{c: Verse 1}
[A] [F#m] [A],        Tum bin kya hai jeena,
[A] [G],        kya hai jeena
[G] [A],        Tum bin kya hai jeena
[A] [D],        Tum bin jiya jaaye kaise
[G] [C],        Kaise jiya jaaye tum bin
[A] [D],        Sadiyon se lambi hain raate
[G] [C],        Sadiyon se lambe hue din
[A] [G],        Aa jaao lautkar tum,
[G] [A],        yeh dil keh raha hai...
[A] [C],        Phir shaam-e-tanhaai jaagi
[A] [E],        Phir yaad tum aa rahe ho
[A] [C],        Phir jaan nikalne lagi hai
[A] [E],        Phir mujhko tadpaa rahe ho
[D] [E] [A],        Phir mujhko tadpaa rahe ho
[A] [D],        Is dil me yaado ke mele hai
[G] [C],        Tum bin bahut hum akele hain
[A] [G],        Aa jaao lautkar tum,
[G] [A],        yeh dil keh raha hai...
[A] [C],        Kya kya na socha tha maine
[A] [E],        Kya kya na sapne sajaaye
[A] [C],        Kya kya na chaaha tha dil ne
[A] [E],        Kya kya na armaan jagaaye
[D] [E] [A],        Kya kya na armaan jagaaye
[A] [D],        Is dil se toofaan guzarte hai
[G] [C],        Tum bin to jeete na marte hai
[A] [G],        Aa jaao lautkar tum,
[G] [A],        yeh dil keh raha hai...
